{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Blessed be HaShem.</b> Every expression of 'blessed' with regard to HaShem — whether in Scripture, whether in Mishnah, whether in prayer, whether in a commandment, whether over fruits — all are explained as an expression of granting peace, 'shalomir' in the vernacular, or as an expression of praise."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:35.055936289Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}